# Editing

- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones
- Preserve existing formatting and indentation
- Do not expand scope beyond the requested change
- Run the linter after changes; fix any new issues (`npm run lint`)
- Typical component folder: `index.tsx`; add `types.ts` and/or `styles.css` when needed (not every component has all three)
- Complex components (e.g. `raid-tracker-table/`) may include colocated subcomponents
- Colocate tests as `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx` beside the module under test; use `src/test/fixtures.ts` and `renderWithTheme` for MUI component tests
